Groovy side:

groovy

def retractionScripts = domains.collect { domain ->
    def dn = domain.name.replaceAll("\\.", "_")
    "${domain.targetEnv}_${dn}.sh"
}.join(" ")

-e RETRACTION_SCRIPTS="${retractionScripts}" \
In the shell block, after vault:

bash

    for script in $RETRACTION_SCRIPTS; do
        ${CI_DIR}/scripts/generate_retractions/${script}
    done
